      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Despite its name, Lake Shore sits inland from Chesapeake Bay; the bay’s influence still shapes its climate and seafood culture.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
